#: beatstamp/ui/dialogs.py:1427
msgid "Sigelith Desktop is built from open-source components. Each one is listed with its licence and with what it does in this program. The full licence texts are delivered with the program — in the second tab — and the file NOTICE lists every file of the package with its licence."
